{
  "slug": "luma-mcp",
  "name": "Luma Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "lu.ma events MCP server. Create/update events, ticket types, coupons, list RSVPs, email attendees. Draft+confirm on every write. 14 tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `SessionStart` and **1 MCP server**, `luma`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install luma-mcp@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/luma-mcp`.\n\nlu.ma events MCP server. Create events, set ticket prices, issue coupon codes, list RSVPs, and email attendees. All writes go through draft+confirm so nothing posts to Luma until you explicitly approve. Built on the official Luma public API.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
